--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Gather Motion 1:1  (slice1; segments: 1)  (cost=1.02..2.14 rows=3 width=28) (actual time=0.189..0.190 rows=0.00 loops=1)
   ->  Hash Join  (cost=1.02..2.07 rows=3 width=28) (actual time=0.000..0.016 rows=0.00 loops=1)
         Hash Cond: (a.c1 = b.c1)
         ->  Seq Scan on t1 a  (cost=0.00..1.01 rows=1 width=16) (actual time=0.000..0.015 rows=0.00 loops=1)
         ->  Hash  (cost=1.01..1.01 rows=1 width=16) (never executed)
               ->  Seq Scan on t1 b  (cost=0.00..1.01 rows=1 width=16) (never executed)
